+      <main class="content">
+        <div id="overview"><div class="eyebrow">THE QUICKSTART GUIDE</div><h1>小小命令，大有版本。</h1><p class="lead">用 Git 记录代码的每一次变化，让协作井井有条。<br>从安装到第一个仓库，只需几分钟，开启你的版本管理之旅。</p><div class="metadata"><span><svg class="icon"><use href="#clock"/></svg>约 5 分钟</span><span class="divider"></span><span>适合初次使用</span><span class="divider"></span><span>macOS / Linux / Windows</span></div></div>
+        <div class="journey" aria-label="上手流程"><a href="#installation" class="journey-item"><b>1</b>安装工具</a><span class="journey-line"></span><a href="#configuration" class="journey-item"><b>2</b>配置身份</a><span class="journey-line"></span><a href="#commands" class="journey-item"><b>3</b>开始使用</a></div>
+        <section id="installation"><div class="section-heading"><span class="step">01 /</span><h2>安装 Git</h2></div><p class="section-description">打开终端，选择你的操作系统，运行对应的安装命令。</p>
+          <div class="codebox"><div class="code-head"><div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="选择操作系统"><button class="tab" id="tab-macos" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="install-panel" data-os="macos">macOS</button><button class="tab" id="tab-linux" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" tabindex="-1" data-os="linux">Linux</button><button class="tab" id="tab-windows" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="install-panel" tabindex="-1" data-os="windows">Windows</button></div><button class="copy" data-copy="install-code" aria-label="复制安装命令"><svg class="icon"><use href="#copy"/></svg>复制</button></div><div id="install-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-macos"><pre><span class="prompt">$</span><code id="install-code"><span class="cmd">brew</span> install git</code></pre></div></div>
+          <p class="help-line" id="install-help"><span class="tiny-arrow">↳</span><span>需要先安装 <a href="https://brew.sh/zh-cn/">Homebrew</a>；也可以使用 <a href="https://git-scm.com/downloads">其他安装方式</a>。</span></p>
+          <div class="note"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg><div>安装完成后，运行 <code class="inline-code">git --version</code>。看到 <code class="inline-code">git version 2.x.x</code> 等版本信息，即表示安装成功。</div></div>
+        </section>
+        <section id="configuration"><div class="section-heading"><span class="step">02 /</span><h2>让 Git 认识你</h2></div><p class="section-description">设置提交记录中的名字和邮箱。全局配置只需一次，之后的新仓库也会使用它。</p><div class="codebox"><div class="code-head"><span>TERMINAL</span><button class="copy" data-copy="config-code" aria-label="复制配置命令"><svg class="icon"><use href="#copy"/></svg>复制</button></div><pre><code id="config-code"><span class="comment"># 替换为你自己的名字和邮箱</span>
+<span class="cmd">git</span> config --global user.name <span class="arg">"Your Name"</span>
+<span class="cmd">git</span> config --global user.email <span class="arg">"you@example.com"</span></code></pre></div><div class="note"><svg class="icon"><use href="#info"/></svg><div><strong>一个小提示</strong>　这些信息会出现在提交记录中。需要保护隐私时，可使用代码托管平台提供的隐私邮箱；它们不用于登录认证。</div></div></section>
+        <section id="commands"><div class="section-heading"><span class="step">03 /</span><h2>记住这三个常用命令</h2></div><p class="section-description">获取项目、了解改动、回看历史。从这三个动作开始熟悉 Git。</p><div class="command-list">
+          <article class="command"><div class="command-title"><span class="command-index">01</span><h3>克隆一个仓库</h3><span class="command-tag">git clone</span></div><p>将远程项目下载到本地。以下以 Hello-World 公开示例仓库为例。</p><div class="codebox"><pre><span class="prompt">$</span><code id="clone-code"><span class="cmd">git</span> clone https://github.com/octocat/Hello-World.git</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="clone-code" aria-label="复制克隆命令"><svg class="icon"><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></article>
+          <article class="command"><div class="command-title"><span class="command-index">02</span><h3>查看当前状态</h3><span class="command-tag">git status</span></div><p>先运行 <code class="inline-code">cd Hello-World</code> 进入项目，再查看分支与尚未提交的改动。</p><div class="codebox"><pre><span class="prompt">$</span><code id="status-code"><span class="cmd">git</span> status</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="status-code" aria-label="复制状态命令"><svg class="icon"><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div></article>
+          <article class="command"><div class="command-title"><span class="command-index">03</span><h3>浏览提交历史</h3><span class="command-tag">git log</span></div><p>在项目目录中，以一行一条的方式查看提交，快速了解项目的演进。</p><div class="codebox"><pre><span class="prompt">$</span><code id="log-code"><span class="cmd">git</span> log --oneline</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy="log-code" aria-label="复制历史命令"><svg class="icon"><use href="#copy"/></svg></button></div><p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:10px">如果进入分页浏览界面，按 <code class="inline-code">q</code> 退出。</p></article>
+        </div></section>
+        <div class="next"><div class="success"><svg class="icon"><use href="#check"/></svg></div><div><h3>准备就绪，接下来开始创造。</h3><p>继续学习暂存、提交与分支，把每一次进步留在历史里。</p></div><a href="https://git-scm.com/book/zh/v2">阅读 Pro Git<svg class="icon"><use href="#arrow"/></svg></a></div>
